244
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:43,677
Don't forget to pay out 700 life points if

245
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:46,217
you want to keep Imperial Order in effect.

246
00:14:46,300 --> 00:14:50,040
I can't afford to give up
that much, so I'll destroy it.

247
00:14:51,540 --> 00:14:52,370
Nice!

248
00:14:52,453 --> 00:14:55,200
Now Kaiba can use his
magic cards again. Awesome.

249
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,357
Now I understand Kaiba's game plan.

250
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:59,617
And if Lecter can't
restore his life points,

251
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:02,377
then his whole dueling
strategy goes down the drain.

252
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:05,640
Now Kaiba may win this
duel after all! Lecter,

253
00:15:05,740 --> 00:15:08,217
how did you ever think you could
run Kaiba Corp if you can't

254
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:11,457
even control the numbers in a
simple game of Duel Monsters?

255
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:12,370
Silence!

256
00:15:12,500 --> 00:15:13,820
I'm not done yet!

257
00:15:14,060 --> 00:15:16,160
I summon a monster in defense mode,

258
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:19,860
then command my satellite
cannon to attack your behemoth!

259
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:30,480
I'm so sorry I had to ruin
your good mood, Mr. Kyber.

260
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,360
Don't worry.

261
00:15:33,220 --> 00:15:34,260
Not bad.

262
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:38,340
First, I'll activate my Pot of Greed card.

263
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:41,020
This allows me to draw two more cards.

264
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:45,760
And then, I'll summon the
monster Possessed Dark Soul.

265
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:53,700
Now, Dark Soul, attack
Lecter's face-down monster!

266
00:15:59,580 --> 00:16:00,877
Stop right there!

267
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,840
Reveal Dream Sprite!

268
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:05,700
Attacking this activated
its special power.

269
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:09,254
It can redirect your attack
to any of my other monsters.

270
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:10,940
Just watch, Mr. Paiva.

271
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:17,680
So I'll transfer your attack
to my satellite cannon.

272
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:20,690
Hold on.

273
00:16:21,020 --> 00:16:23,637
Kaiba's master's not strong
enough to reach that high.

274
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,940
I'm untouchable.

275
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:30,077
Just one more turn, and my satellite cannon's
attack points will be raised to 2,000.

276
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:33,680
Enough to wipe out your
remaining life points, Mr. Kaiba.

277
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:39,440
I'll take a life point boost from
my trap card and end my turn.

278
00:16:40,700 --> 00:16:41,760
That snake!

279
00:16:42,020 --> 00:16:43,477
How come he didn't attack?

280
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:44,736
You heard him, Joey.

281
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:46,660
He's charging up his cannon.

282
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:48,877
For one final attack!

283
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:51,740
I'll take down your little space cannon.

284
00:16:52,180 --> 00:16:53,200
Good luck.

285
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:55,951
Most monsters could never reach that high.

286
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,430
Oh, man.

287
00:16:57,513 --> 00:17:00,197
Does Kaiba have a monster strong
enough to crush that thing?

288
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:05,120
Wait, there may be one in his deck, but
who knows if he can summon it in time?

289
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:07,960
It all comes down to this next draw.

290
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:11,120
Come on, Seto.

291
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:12,660
This is it.

292
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:17,460
And now behold, my ultimate creature!

293
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:21,640
What is it?

294
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,040
You'll see.

295
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:26,180
But first, I'll place
this in defense mode.

296
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:30,600
Now, my deck master, show
your special ability.

297
00:17:31,100 --> 00:17:33,920
At a cost of 500 of my life points,

298
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:37,960
Lord of Dragons allows me to
summon any dragon from my hand.

299
00:17:38,580 --> 00:17:41,260
Now, I'll sacrifice both of my monsters.

300
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:47,337
What do you think you're doing, Mr. Kylo?

301
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:49,820
You're about to find out!

302
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:53,020
I summon Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

303
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,960
There's your target!

304
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:02,620
Go, Blue-Eyes!

305
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:08,060
Take down his satellite cannon now!

306
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:09,570
No!

307
00:18:09,660 --> 00:18:12,060
Do you have any idea what this means?

308
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:14,880
I know exactly what it means, Lecter.

309
00:18:15,100 --> 00:18:16,340
This duel's over!

310
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:23,760
I know your satellite cannon only has
attack points when it's about to attack.

311
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:28,180
Otherwise, it has an
attack power of... Zero.

312
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:29,670
No!

313
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:33,020
That means once I attack,
you lose everything.

314
00:18:38,420 --> 00:18:41,177
You should have known
better than to challenge me.

315
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:45,200
Now, my blue eyes, finish him
off with white lightning attack!

316
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:59,680
Looks like you won't be leaving
cyberspace anytime soon Nice job,

317
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,980
Kaiba wasted that big five creep

318
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:03,330
No,

319
00:19:03,413 --> 00:19:09,540
I was so close to finally escaping from
this digital dungeon Where's Momba?

320
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:13,380
You'll never see your brother again, Mr.

321
00:19:13,580 --> 00:19:16,300
Kaiba However, I'll be back

322
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:20,960
I knew Seto would crush that creep!

323
00:19:22,060 --> 00:19:24,997
Mokuba, how can you still
be on your brother's side?

324
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:27,237
He betrayed you to control Kaiba Corp.

325
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:29,849
I would stand by my
brother no matter what.

326
00:19:29,940 --> 00:19:33,420
We're family, and nothing's
gonna separate us. Nothing.

327
00:19:33,980 --> 00:19:35,880
I'll show him, family.

328
00:19:39,380 --> 00:19:40,210
Mokuba.

329
00:19:41,300 --> 00:19:43,140
I'm coming, Mokuba!

330
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,880
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
